## Core skill

**[SKILL_FRONTEND]** — always active for frontend work.

## Skills — invoke BEFORE the edit, not after it bounces (LAW10)

Each skill below has a concrete trigger. When your work matches it, invoke the skill
(Skill tool) BEFORE the first hand-edit — not after a hand-patch fails. **Hand-editing
an area a skill covers twice without loading it = you already skipped it (LAW10): stop
and load it now.** "It's just a quick fix" is the rationalization that skips the skill —
if you're reasoning about the area (layout, types, a store, UI copy), that IS the skill's
work.

